  "title": "Allow zero length source lengths to tvb_bytes_to_str[_punct]",
  "description": "Move the \"source length is zero\" check in bytes_to_str and\nbytes_to_str_punct before the \"was a null pointer passed in\ncheck.\" The input isn't a null terminated string, only an array\nof bytes, and ensure_contiguous returns a NULL pointer for length\nzero.\n\nChange the assertions in the tvb_ versions to allow the length to\nbe zero as well, to reduce extra checking that dissectors might\nneed to do.\n\nFix #20607 (See the related #19705).",
